 "- **Multilayer network (MLP)** — Layers of neurons where each layer's outputs feed the next. Depth = representational power; width = capacity per layer.",
 "- **Activation function** — The nonlinearity (ReLU, sigmoid, tanh, GELU family) applied after each affine transform. Without it, any depth collapses to a single linear map.",
